117: and the lead rulings (evidence and counts: docs/reviews/frame-unit-lessons-2026-11-16.md). A frame fault rarely shows in
118: the frame read: the scope writer guesses in days.csv, the unit fixer cannot change days.csv, and the fix lands on the
119: lead. Say these things in the frame so nobody below it has to guess:
120: 17. **Day kinds defined.** A "Day kinds." bullet in The course in brief, using the definitions of docs/GLOSSARY.md
121:     (row "teaching day"; first teaching is Understanding, Fluency only practises, drafting and editing are
122:     Application). Say what Fluency looks like in this course, or that it has little or none.
