130:     from a day a topic is first taught. An end day holds at most one full performance; a unit owning many standards or
131:     a long product budgets more end days.
132: 20. **Checks claim samples.** "What it checks" names the units sampled, the task forms and any recent unit record
133:     reused unscored, never "every code"; a check right after a unit's end draws that unit's items from earlier units.
