er card, critique card, Curio Class's own. Free path: card, crayon and scrap paper. Once-a-week path: 4 sessions | After unit 10 because the whole combines contents recorded and shaped there and unit 9's single message; purpose and setting grow from grade 1's meaning and viewers. Short because the contents are already made | Candidate: a whole made for a public place by a living maker from Africa or the Americas, described and linked | Paik's work flickers on its screens: the class sees a still photograph only, never a video of it (no flashing light). The sensitivity agent reads the museum's page first. Hazards and controls: glue sticks, blunt scissors, devices by the turn card, screen breaks. Critique talks about the work, never the maker. Agent reads: sensitivity; safety (hands-on). |
