307: Each check day is a written sitting: set-up 3 minutes, self-check 5, the written items 25, collecting and clean-up 5,
308: with no device out but the teacher's screen for the unseen piece. Every student's evidence is collected once in a
309: window; no artifact is scored twice. Days above are band course days (year 7 starts on day 65, year 8 on day 129).
310: On the calendar, each mid-year check falls on school day 83 and its respond day on 85; each year-end check on school
311: day 158 and its respond day on 160.
