216:   their own `.I`, `.II`, `.III` ids; no wrong-year id found (pilot finding 4 does not recur).
217: - **Units and reasons:** every unit has a question, a reason and id-by-id end-of-unit evidence (the pilot finding 1
218:   fix is carried in).
219: - **Days:** plan.py 0 failures for all four. Hand check: K-2 units 18, 22, 10, 10 a year; 3-5 sums by year match;
220:   6-8 14, 18, 14, 14; 9-12 Level 1 12, 30, 34, 38, 40, Levels 2 and 3 6, 32, 38, 38, 40, Level 4 48, 28, 40, 38; the
221:   once-a-week and short paths sum correctly (32 sessions, 80 days).
