ma-g2-make ma-g1-make => ma-g3-make revision-log => revision-log Combine several pieces of content into one whole project, placing them to draw the eye, then try a change near the end and describe how it read. What changes: several contents are combined into a whole and the result of a change is described, where grade 1 spotted a pattern. Assessed by a finished piece and a short talk scored met, partly or not yet. Teacher note: no student is recorded, photographed or filmed without the family's yes; a face or voice is never required (hands, the work or the sound alone will do); a student who does not want to be recorded is observed live and the teacher's mark stands; kept work stays on the student's, family's or school's own device.
